# Deny by default. This tree also holds OAuth credentials, full conversation
# transcripts (projects/), prompt history, and a 1.3G plugin cache — none of
# which belong in a repo. Add new config explicitly below.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
!RTK.md
!statusline.sh
!settings.json
!hooks/
!hooks/**
# Skills: allowlist individually. Most under skills/ are third-party with no
# license recorded, and this repo is meant to be publishable — vendoring
# someone else's unlicensed work is not ours to redistribute.
!skills/
skills/**
!skills/ui-styling/
!skills/ui-styling/**
!templates/
!templates/**
!install.sh
!check.sh
!.githooks/
!.githooks/**
!PRACTICES.md
!hooks/output-reminder.sh
!LICENSE
!.github/
!.github/**
